<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Spanish. Everyday words, as banking and budgeting apps use them, rather than literal ones.
    Neutral Spanish that reads naturally in Spain and Latin America; the reader is addressed as "tú".

    Glossary (keep these the same everywhere):
        transaction        movimiento           expense    gasto          income    ingreso
        savings / saved    ahorro / ahorrado    balance    saldo          amount    importe
        category           categoría            settings   Ajustes        note      nota
        backup / restore   copia de seguridad / restaurar                 export    exportar
        delete             eliminar             save       guardar        cancel    cancelar
        undo               deshacer             search     buscar         title     título
        bill (scanned)     recibo               app lock   bloqueo de la app
        screen lock        bloqueo de pantalla  built-in / custom  predefinida / personalizada

    Kept as they are: CSV, Excel, Google Sheets, cashback and the app's name.

    Numbers use Western digits. Not here on purpose: strings marked translatable="false"
    in values/strings.xml, which read the same in every language.
-->
